      "abstained": false,
      "answer": "Exposed vaccines should be labeled \"DO NOT USE—TEMPERATURE EXCURSION\" and moved to the correct storage conditions, placed in a separate container apart from other vaccines in the unit, and not discarded. These vaccines should be kept separated and marked \"DO NOT USE—TEMPERATURE EXCURSION\" until a decision can be made about whether the vaccines can still be used.",
